                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.152/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-08-14T12:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                                1926—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 1:47 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>50. Department’s instruction number 77, July 28. Draft of treaty was submitted to
                    the Foreign Office this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
